<view class="home-chat">
  <view class="intro">
    <view class="intro__top">
      <text class="intro__eyebrow">AI 预问诊</text>
      <view class="avatar">{{initial}}</view>
    </view>
    <text class="intro__title">你好，{{account}}</text>
    <text class="intro__desc">描述身体不适，智能助手会先了解情况，再给出就诊建议。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="welcome">
    <view class="welcome__head">
      <view class="welcome__badge">AI</view>
      <text class="welcome__name">智能导诊助手</text>
      <view class="welcome__online">
        <text class="dot"></text>
        <text>在线</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="welcome__bubble">
      您好，请用一句话告诉我：哪里不舒服、大概多久了？
    </view>
    <text class="welcome__example">例如：肚子疼三天了，还拉肚子</text>
  </view>

  <view class="composer">
    <view class="input-row">
      <input
        class="chat-input"
        value="{{input}}"
        placeholder="描述您的不适…"
        placeholder-class="placeholder"
        confirm-type="send"
        cursor-spacing="24"
        bindinput="onInput"
        bindconfirm="onSend"
      />
      <button
        class="send-btn {{loading || !input ? 'is-disabled' : ''}}"
        hover-class="send-btn--active"
        loading="{{loading}}"
        disabled="{{loading || !input}}"
        bindtap="onSend"
      >
        <text wx:if="{{!loading}}">发送</text>
      </button>
    </view>
    <text class="composer__note">内容仅用于本次预问诊，医生可查看预问诊记录</text>
  </view>

  <bottom-nav active="home" />
</view>
